<title>UK: Tie Rack had quick browse at Knot Shop.</title>
<headline>Tie Rack had quick browse at Knot Shop.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>International tie retailer Tie Rack Plc said on Thursday that it had taken a look at U.S neckwear retailer the Knot Shop, but had no plans to pursue the company any further.</p>
<p>&quot;We did look at them, but based on what we have seen we are not progressing,&quot; Nigel McGinley told Reuters in an interview.</p>
<p>Tie Rack has around 16.5 million stg net cash.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
